WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.500
A Visit to Karasuma's House

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:44.410
Kazune-kun!!!

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:45.840
Karin…

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:54.040
Could it possibly be…

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:58.420
some wonderful person somewhere is proposing to me?

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:01.340
But who could it be?

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:04.400
If it was Kazune-kun…

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.900
Karin-chan… she flew off…

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.480
Nishikiyori, was it you?!

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.860
Using that ridiculous method of proposing…

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:20.900
Me?

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.240
I was sure that it was you who was proposing…

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:28.450
Eh… Then that means, someone is seriously proposing to Hanazono-san?..

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:32.710
Ehh?! I wonder who.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.180
Who knows.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.190
This is…

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:49.740
Huh? But where's the one who's proposing to me?

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:53.160
Eh?!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:54.940
Ah!

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.690
Flying-in-the-sky glasses guy!

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.570
I'm not "flying-in-the-sky glasses guy"!

00:02:58.570 --> 00:02:59.780
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.440
Why are you here?

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:04.880
Same for you, amateur goddess, why are you-

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.210
Kirika-senpai!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.340
Eh? Why is Karin-chan here?

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.300
Senpai! It's awful!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.550
Cosplaying glasses guy suddenly forced me to come here!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.550
I'm not "cosplaying glasses guy".

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:29.300
I'm Karasuma Kiri- I feel sick…

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:31.100
It's alright, Karin-chan.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:35.410
Nii-san, the one you were supposed to bring wasn't Karin-chan.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:42.360
You spent so much money chartering that helicopter…

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:47.240
and carrying out that proposal plan and going to all these extreme measures.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.260
C-Change of plan.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.040
Could it be…

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.660
you're air sick?

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:58.170
If that damned helicopter pilot wasn't so bad at driving…

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:02.460
I would've captured Nishikiyori, and everything would've gone according to plan!

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.630
Eh?! Then, you mean…

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:07.430
you were proposing to Micchi, and not me?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:11.430
I didn't know that glasses guy felt that way about Micchi…

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.220
No, that's not it…

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.730
Fine! Now that this has happened…

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.540
you'll do anyway!

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.150
You're the replacement.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:25.780
You'll do anyway; replacement?!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.420
That's not how you propose, you idiot!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.240
Karin-chan!

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:35.510
Damn… wait amateur goddess!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:40.130
Nii-san, you're probably still sick from the flight.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.100
You need to rest.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.800
Geez!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.510
What does he think a girl's feelings are?

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.180
Anyway, who would marry glasses guy?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.100
Anyhow, right now I need to hurry up and get out of here…

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:55.280
Who's there?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.380
The other Himeka-chan…

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.460
You're the girl from that time…

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.670
You lost some weight.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:15.220
That was because I was wearing that sumo suit…

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:25.340
You sure have lots of books.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:28.730
Because I'm not allowed to play outside.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.840
I see…

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:33.930
Because we broke glasses guy's ring.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.060
Hey, can you read this to me?

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.890
Eh? But…

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:39.140
You can't?

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:42.980
I have to hurry home, since everyone's probably worried about me…

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:53.820
She sure is late… Karin-chan…

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:56.620
Maybe… she accepted the proposal?

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:00.620
Eh?! Do you think so?

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.250
Even so…

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.840
I wonder who the groom is.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.130
Hmm… I wonder who…

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:10.520
If it's not me or Kazune-kun…

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:26.460
Karasuma… what're you planning?

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:33.530
Kazune-sama's body can't take any more god-transformations.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.410
Karasuma, who doesn't have a ring, can't transform.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:41.680
So I won't transform either!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:44.180
Karin…

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:51.090
And then, the student council president of love and justice, Kirio…

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:54.380
went to save the princess and beat the monsters.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:56.090
Take that!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.740
He got us!

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:03.640
Wow! Kirio-sama's power is so amazing!

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:07.770
From now on, we'll change our name to the "Kiriozu"!

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:12.350
And then… he saved the princess from the castle.

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:14.530
Ah, Kirio-sama!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.530
You came to save me!

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:20.740
Princess! Now that I am here, everything is alright!

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.370
But, in front of them…

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:26.330
the amateur goddess had appeared!

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:28.420
Hold it right there!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.420
Clad-in-cotton glasses guy!

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:33.670
I am indeed clad in cotton…

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:35.080
but I am not "glasses guy"!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.970
I am the student council president of love and justice,…

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.300
Karasuma Kirrrio!

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:42.140
I won't let you leave here alive!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:46.520
Prepare yourself!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.770
God Thunder!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.980
Student Council President Beam!

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:57.990
With that, the student council president of love and justice,…

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:03.010
Kirio, restored peace to the country.

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:05.610
The end.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:09.540
Hey, why am I the monster in the story?

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.000
Read this one next.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:16.380
"Super Detective Kirio vs. the Amateur Goddess"…

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:19.640
"Amazing Coal Miner Kirio vs. the Amateur Goddess"…

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.890
Hey, are these all about Kirio?

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.600
They're interesting, stories about Kirio.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.230
Is that so?

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:32.540
Stories with the amateur goddess are especially interesting.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.710
Did glasses guy make all these?

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.880
Amateur goddess!

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.120
Get away from Himeka!

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.330
Prince-with-puffy-pants glasses guy!

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.040
I'm not "prince-with-puffy-pants glasses guy"!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.210
I'm Karasuma Kirrrio-

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.750
No, I mean, Karasuma Kirio.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.550
Eh! So you're the amateur goddess.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.800
Ah, no, my real name is Hanazono Karin.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:06.600
So, you're the idiot, foolish, ditzy, stupid, the worst amateur goddess?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.940
Hey! Stop putting weird images in her head!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.150
And since when was I ditzy?!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.480
Hey, Kirio-chan, let's all play together.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.240
Eh, but…

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.780
Let's play!

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.660
Isn't that alright, nii-san?

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.490
Kirika?..

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.700
Once in a while, it's nice to have fun together…

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.960
and even Karin-chan is here today.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.920
True, if we fight here, I'd be putting Himeka in danger.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.630
Right? Karin-chan let's play.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:37.020
If you say so, Kirika-senpai…

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:45.720
Himeka, your favorite car, the pink one.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.060
Yep, I'll be pink.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.850
I'll be blue.

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.650
I'm yellow.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.180
I wonder what color I should be…

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:55.710
Oh, I know!

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.480
Ouch!

00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:00.280
This one! This is your car!

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:03.950
Hey! Why do I have to be black?!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.580
Black's so not cute!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:07.040
Listen.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.330
The player's who play as cars…

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:13.580
are supposed to flee from the evil amateur goddess's truck.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:18.920
That is one of the rules of this game that the amazing Kirrrio made in his free time!

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.510
So glasses guy made this game as well.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:26.640
So that is why the amateur goddess has to be this ugly black truck!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:29.600
Nii-san, can't she just be the red one?

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.890
No, she can't!

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:34.520
This is my game, so she has to follow my rules!

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:38.070
It's not like I wanted to play it though…

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:41.020
This will be fun, Amateur Goddess-san.

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:43.880
R-Right…

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.490
Oh, great! I got nine!

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:51.140
Kirio-chan, you're amazing!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:54.040
Alright, next is my turn!

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.710
Alright! Ten!

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.230
What?

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.260
One…

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.180
Two…

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.850
Three…

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.880
Four…

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.740
Hey, hey!

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:31.200
Hurry up or get off the road…

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.410
toy-car glasses guy!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.580
I'm not "toy-car glasses guy"!

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:41.800
I'm Karasuma Kiri-oh!

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:50.450
There, Kirio-chan, you have to miss a turn because amateur goddess passed you.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:54.640
You have to follow the rules, don't you now?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.810
Himeka-chan, this game is so much fun!

00:11:57.810 --> 00:11:59.420
It is fun, isn't it?

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.320
What're you doing, Kirika?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.280
Your turn is next.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.570
Yes, yes…

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.420
I got it, nii-san.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:12.290
Here, it's Kirio-chan's turn.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.600
Yeah!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.390
This is…

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.500
It says you have to move your car back to where you were before.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.130
Damn it!

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:23.210
Are you alright?

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.090
You're still not feeling well…

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.470
I'm fine…

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:30.900
Kirio-chan's car has to move back… to-

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.240
Himeka!

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.580
Himeka-chan?

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:39.750
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:43.290
I am God!

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:48.250
You moron.

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:48.250
It's a croquette!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:51.740
Himeka, are you alright?

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.500
I'm just a little tired.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.580
Amateur goddess!

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.410
It's your fault that Himeka is…

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:59.020
No way!

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:06.590
It was lots of fun playing with everyone today, right, Kirio-chan?

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:09.260
Sure… I guess.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.470
I want to play again tomorrow.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.260
You'll be able to play again tomorrow.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:15.240
Amateur Goddess-san too?

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.520
It's fine, right?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.440
- Of course! 
- Of course!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:23.000
Ah, that's good!

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:25.320
Damn you, amateur goddess!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.110
It's all your fault that Himeka is…

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.200
What's that?!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.120
The one who attacked us first was you! So it's your fault!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:35.260
If you feel at least a little bit bad, then join our side!

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.580
Take it easy, nii-san…

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.470
you're still sick.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.010
If I still had the ring…

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.440
things would be different.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:54.760
Himeka… really loves the games and books that brother makes.

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:58.680
Sorry… for making you stay and play with us.

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:00.100
It's okay…

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:05.370
Glasses guy… really treasures Himeka-chan, doesn't he?

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:08.400
And to Himeka-chan…

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:14.910
he probably seems like a brother who is kinder and more fun than anyone else.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:20.000
For brother… the power of the ring that allowed him to transform…

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.930
was his only reason for living.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.920
Is that…

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.670
He thought the only way to protect Himeka…

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.940
was to use the ring.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.220
He's the same…

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.010
as Kazune-kun.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.850
But, because he lost his ring in the battle the other day…

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.990
he can't transform any more.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.890
And, as you see now…

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:44.830
he's just a regular student council president.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:50.000
But, you know, I like brother that way.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.530
It almost feels like…

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.630
how it did when we were kids.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:00.930
Our life was so fun in those days.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.630
Brother still desires the ring's power though.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.940
Kirika-senpai…

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.470
I want power…

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:14.820
I want to protect Himeka.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:29.940
Kirika-senpai… can't we stop this fighting?

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.780
Karin-chan…

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.950
Without having to fight…

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.570
without having to hurt people…

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:39.540
I think that we'd definitely be able to find…

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.370
a way to save both Himeka-chans!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.750
You're right. I think so, too.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.790
If we just talked to brother…

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.040
Glasses guy?

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.880
He should understand.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.340
Let's both do our best.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.760
Yes!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.050
Since it's late already, I'll take you home.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.590
Kujyou-kun and the others must be worried about you.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:59.310
Thank you very much!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:02.220
By the way… that dress looks good on you.

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:04.770
Eh? D-Do you think so?

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:07.040
I can't let you go home.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.320
If you want to join our side…

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.650
let me defeat you here.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:18.370
Nii-san, you're still talking about that…

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.430
Hey, glasses guy!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.250
Let's look together…

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:26.110
for a way to save both Himeka-chans!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.330
What nonsense.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:29.840
It's exactly as Karin-chan says!

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.380
Because, nii-san, you can't-

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.380
Look out!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.300
This is…

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:40.140
Get out of the way, Kirika!

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:41.140
No!

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.810
What is this power?

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:45.370
Brother's ring should have been broken…

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:48.270
Nii-san?

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.520
Glasses guy?

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.750
I have no need for you anymore.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.410
Kirika-senpai!

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.160
What are you thinking, glasses guy?!

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:07.500
Hurting Kirika-senpai like that!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.520
I am God!

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:28.770
What should I do?

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:31.120
If I dodge it now, it'll hit Kirika-senpai.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.230
Huh?

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:35.710
Kazune-kun's bird?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:41.910
You're…

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.080
You're the one from that time.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.660
Why are you here?

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:48.790
This isn't the time to talk.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:52.540
I feel a lot of evil energy here…

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.340
coming from that ring.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.060
That ring?

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.010
That's…

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.090
Senpai?

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:03.640
No way… Nii-san, you put on the ring…

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.930
It seems he is being controlled.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.430
Controlled?

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:11.580
Yes. It's the same as that time with me…

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:21.130
Even though he knew he shouldn't wear the ring…

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:26.330
The Goddess of the Night, Nyx Noir's transformation!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.590
Kirika-senpai?

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.550
That ring is evil!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.170
If I just get rid of that ring…

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.510
Get out of the way.

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:52.560
Kirika-senpai, stop! Stop!

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:56.150
Let go! If I just get rid of that ring!

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.080
I will never forgive him!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:03.710
If that ring never existed, brother would…

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:07.590
Karin-chan?

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.500
Thank you.

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.180
I'm alright now.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:18.840
No… Um, I just thought that if I did this…

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:21.550
you might feel more at ease.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.720
I said it, didn't I?

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.600
That we should do our best.

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:27.450
Yes!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.160
I will help as well.

00:19:33.890 --> 00:19:35.660
Our target is that ring!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.780
All of our attacks are being deflected!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:48.490
There's no way we can beat such violent power.

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.970
The only way is to combine our powers.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.960
You two, channel your power into me!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.270
- Yes! 
- Yes!

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.100
Terebro Nox!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.910
We did it!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.030
Nii-san…

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.170
Kiri…ka?

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:30.260
Thank goodness…

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:34.290
Kirika-senpai… glasses guy…

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.920
What happened to me?

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.630
It's alright now… nii-san.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.920
I'm sorry…

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.670
for being a pathetic brother.

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:45.350
What are you saying?

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.970
Even if what you do fails…

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.470
even if you're just a student council president…

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:54.570
To me… you're so much more, nii-san…

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.390
Nii-… san?..

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:12.590
I really am sorry.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.810
You can disappear now.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.640
You are…

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:27.480
Senpai!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:34.390
Karin-chan… Please save…

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:42.900
Ki-Kirika-senpai…

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:46.930
Kirika-senpai!!!

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.670
Just now…

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:09.650
No way… Kirika-senpai…

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:15.510
You…

00:22:15.510 --> 00:22:17.480
Do you realize…

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:19.620
just what you're doing?

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:21.460
You're…

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:24.020
the worst, glasses guy!

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:26.420
Is that all you have to say?

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:09.670
Here, and There, Glasses Guy is Everywhere
